id: sleek-plating
name: Sleek Plating
order: 2
optionOf: survivor
optionEffect: 2
description: >
  Increase your Defense Value by 1/2 (rounded up) of your Plating’s Apparel Bonus.
text: >
  Sleek Plating [Passive]: Increase your Defense Value by 1/2 (rounded up) of your Plating’s Apparel Bonus.

---

# The Plating's Apparel Bonus - nothing while it is Inactive (actor-character.mjs naturalArmor).
[passive]
defenseValue += ceil(naturalArmor.apparelBonus / 2);
